  "question": {
    "text": "The given lens is broken into four parts and rearranged as shown. If the initial focal length is $f$ then after rearrangement the equivalent focal length is-\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/iaDcJLPT7cdlw7MhByr5aEMjKOw_fw4MqXt7of4IIWM.original.fullsize.png\">",
